.TH OCR\-TELA\-ATALHO 1 "2026-08-27" "ocr-tela 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ocr\-tela\-atalho \- bind ocr-tela to a GNOME keyboard shortcut
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ocr\-tela\-atalho
.RB [ \-b
.IR binding ]
.RB [ \-c
.IR command ]
.RB [ \-r ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Registers a custom GNOME keyboard shortcut that runs
.BR ocr\-tela (1),
preserving any shortcuts already configured.
.PP
This is a separate, optional step on purpose: keyboard shortcuts are user
configuration, so installing the package never creates one.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-b " binding" "\fR, \fP" \-\-binding " binding"
Key combination in GNOME syntax. Defaults to
.BR <Super><Shift>t .
.TP
.BI \-c " command" "\fR, \fP" \-\-command " command"
Command to run. Defaults to the
.B ocr\-tela
found in
.BR PATH .
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-remove
Remove the shortcut instead of creating it.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ocr\-tela\-atalho \-\-binding "<Control><Alt>o"
ocr\-tela\-atalho \-\-remove
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ocr\-tela (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Augusto Mateus
